  void DistributeEigenvectors(Matrix<T, General, ColMajor>& eigen_vec);
</pre>


<p>This method is used to distribute eigenvectors between processors (especially for rows that are shared between processors) for a parallel execution. This function should not be used in a regular use. </p>

