</pre>


<p>The method <b>ComputeSplitPreconditioning</b> computes a preconditioning for solving the operator:<br/>
A = &Sigma; coef<sub>i</sub> A<sub>numL(i)</sub> <br/>
This method is virtual, such that you can overload it for your own non-linear eigenproblem. </p>	  

